<h1>Delete Your AthloX Account</h1>
<p><strong>Developer:</strong> Steven Mercado &middot; <strong>App:</strong> AthloX</p>

<p>You can delete your AthloX account and all associated data at any time, directly from inside the app or by emailing us.</p>

<div class="primary">
  <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">In-app (recommended &middot; instant)</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open the AthloX app</li>
    <li>Tap the <strong>Profile</strong> tab</li>
    <li>Open <strong>Settings</strong> (gear icon, top right)</li>
    <li>Scroll to the bottom and tap <strong>Delete my account</strong></li>
    <li>Type <code>DELETE</code> to confirm</li>
    <li>Your account, posts, photos and progress are removed immediately</li>
  </ol>
</div>

<h2>By email (alternative)</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Send an email to <a href="mailto:athloxadmin@gmail.com?subject=AthloX%20Account%20Deletion%20Request">athloxadmin@gmail.com</a></li>
  <li>Use the subject line: <code>AthloX Account Deletion Request</code></li>
  <li>Include the email address associated with your AthloX account in the message body</li>
  <li>We will verify your identity and process the deletion within <strong>30 days</strong></li>
  <li>You will receive a confirmation email once your account has been deleted</li>
</ol>

<h2>Data that is deleted</h2>
<p>When your account is deleted, the following data is permanently removed from our systems:</p>
<ul>
  <li>Your account (email, name, user ID)</li>
  <li>Profile information (weight, height, fitness goals, onboarding preferences)</li>
  <li>Workout plans and workout history (sets, reps, logged exercises)</li>
  <li>GPS run history and associated location data</li>
  <li>Community posts, photos, likes, comments, and follow relationships</li>
  <li>AI Coach conversation history</li>
</ul>

<h2>Data that may be retained</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Anonymised, aggregated analytics</strong> (e.g. total workout counts) may be retained indefinitely as they cannot be linked back to your identity.</li>
  <li><strong>Records required for legal or security purposes</strong> (e.g. abuse reports, fraud prevention logs) may be retained for up to <strong>90 days</strong> after deletion.</li>
  <li><strong>Encrypted backups</strong> may contain a copy of your data for up to <strong>30 days</strong> before they roll over and are permanently overwritten.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Questions?</h2>
<p>If you have any questions about account deletion or how your data is handled, please see our <a href="./index.html">Privacy Policy</a> or email <a href="mailto:athloxadmin@gmail.com">athloxadmin@gmail.com</a>.</p>

